WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.219
Watch and read: Ama asks: Read: “Ama shared a mango with a friend. The other children

00:00:05.219 --> 00:00:08.669
smiled and said thank you.” Which action happened in the story?

00:00:09.533 --> 00:00:14.568
The answer is: shared a mango with a friend. A factual answer is stated in the text.

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:20.136
Watch and read: For your retell practice, read: “Ama found a red ball at the

00:00:20.136 --> 00:00:24.823
playground. Ama gave it back to Kojo. The day ended happily.” Who is the main

00:00:24.823 --> 00:00:25.135
character?

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:30.067
The answer is: Ama. The character is the person the story is about.
